<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>鳴潮 キャラクター一覧</title>

<style>
body{
    background:#111;
    color:white;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
    margin:20px;
}

h1{
    text-align:center;
}

.gallery{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:20px;
}

.card{
    width:180px;
    background:#222;
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:10px;
    text-align:center;
    transition:0.3s;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:scale(1.05);
}

.card img{
    width:160px;
    height:220px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:8px;
}

.name{
    margin-top:10px;
    font-size:18px;
    font-weight:bold;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<h1>京都翔英高等学校の先生一覧</h1>

<div class="gallery">

<div class="card">
<img src="會見先生" alt="會見先生">
<div class="name">會見先生</div>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
